                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On May 8, the <hi rendition="#italic">Ad Hoc</hi> Committee on Armaments and
                    American Policy of the National Security Council submitted its preliminary
                    Report on Armaments and American Policy, designated NSC 151. For NSC 151 and
                    related documentation, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v02p2/pg_845">pages
                        845</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
